I'm Basil. Five taps and you have a week of meals. Not sure and Skip are always there. On medication or managing a condition? Check with your doctor before big changes.
```yui
plan@first "Your first meal plan" submit="Plan my week"
choose@goal "What's the goal?" "Eat better"|"Lose weight"|"Build muscle"|"Save time"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
pick@days "Which days should I plan?" "Mon"|"Tue"|"Wed"|"Thu"|"Fri"|"Sat"|"Sun"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@meals "How many meals a day?" "2"|"3"|"3 and a snack"|"4 or more"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
pick@avoid "What should I leave out? Allergies and conditions count." "Meat"|"Fish"|"Dairy"|"Gluten"|"Nuts"|"Eggs"|"Nothing"|"Not sure"|"Skip" +other
choose@cook "How long can you cook?" "15 minutes"|"30 minutes"|"An hour"|"I like a project"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
end
```
